<question no="30028710" partialPoint="true" point="70" skillType="2" type="ClozeTest">
	<title><![CDATA[Cloze Listening]]></title>
	<direction><![CDATA[音声を聞いて、空所を埋めなさい。]]></direction>
	<questionText><![CDATA[m: Is [everything] all right?
f: Yes, fine, but can I get a drink?
m: Do you want beer, wine, pop, or fruit juice?
f: What kind of beer do you have?
m: We have Budweiser and Carlsberg.
f: [How] [about] soft drinks?
m: Cola, orange, soda, and root beer.
f: I think I'll have a cola please.
m: Certainly. Do you want a snack, too?
f: Yes, please.
m: OK, I'll just be a moment.
...Flight attendant goes to get the drink and comes back...
m: [Here] you are. And I brought some peanuts.
f: Oh, thank you. When is the next meal?
m: About three hours from now.
f: Three hours! I'm pretty hungry.
m: Well, I can give you some more peanuts, and a bread roll.
f: Thank you very much. I [appreciate] that.
m: That's OK. Is this your first visit to the United States?
f: Yes. I'm excited about it.
m: And how long will you stay?
f: Two weeks.
m: Are you on business or vacation?
f: A bit of both. I [work] for a software company, but I have some free time. Can you [recommend] any places?
m: Yosemite National Park has [fantastic] scenery, and it's only about two or three hours from San Francisco by car.
f: That's [close] [to] my company's office! I think I'll go there.]]></questionText>

